-- ===================== GUARDED ACCEPT (this is what fixed 0/1000) =====================
-- Measured live: SHR1 sat at Points = 15, then dropped back to Points = 0 with GetActiveQuest()
-- returning nil, with nothing being killed in between. The quest was being RESTARTED.
--
-- Cause: ~20 call sites fire AcceptQuest:InvokeServer(id) from inside `while` loops on a 0.5s
-- cadence (the RCT/Infinity loop, the Evolution/Offense/Vitality loop, the Summer loops, the
-- ownership ledger used by Star Rage and the Restrictor line, ...). Re-sending AcceptQuest for a
-- quest that is ALREADY accepted makes the server start it over, which resets SavedQuest.Points
-- to 0. For a Capture quest that scores +1 per mob every 2 seconds, a reset every 0.5 seconds
-- means the counter can never leave 0 -- exactly the reported 0/1000 that never moved.
--
-- Kill-count and Fetch quests hid this bug because their progress lives in EnemyIDs/FetchItems
-- rather than Points, so restarting them looked harmless.
--
-- NexoSafeAccept refuses to re-fire on a quest that already has server-side progress, so the
-- accept loops keep their "accept it if it is not accepted / hand it in and restart when finished"
-- behaviour while becoming a no-op for a quest that is mid-run. Also de-duped at 0.75s so several
-- systems asking for the same id in the same tick only produce one remote call -- less spam, too.
NexoAccT = NexoAccT or {}
function NexoSafeAccept(id)
    if not id or id == "" then return false end
    local saved
    local m = NexoQuestMods and NexoQuestMods()
    if m and m.ok then pcall(function() saved = m.QC:GetSavedQuest(id) end) end
    -- In progress and not yet finished -> DO NOT restart it, that is what zeroed the points.
    -- A finished quest still gets re-accepted, which is how the loops hand in + restart.
    if saved and not saved.IsFinished and (tonumber(saved.Points) or 0) > 0 then return false end
    local now = os.clock()
    if (now - (NexoAccT[id] or -1)) < 0.75 then return false end
    NexoAccT[id] = now
    local ok = false
    pcall(function() AcceptQuest:InvokeServer(id) ok = true end)
    return ok
end
