-- ROOT-CAUSE FIX (verified live over MCP):
--   PlayerDataController.PlayerData is a STALE SNAPSHOT. On the same inventory stack it reported
--   Count=4 while the live character inventory reported 7. Auto Summon compared that stale 4
--   against a need of 6 and refused to start -- exactly the "I have 6+ essence and nothing
--   happens" bug. The game's own altar interface counts with:
--       CharacterController.LocalCharacter.Inventory:GetItemCount("ShadowEssence")
