-- ============ SUMMER RAID -> SHARED OVERLORD RAID ENGINE ============
-- The bespoke summer loop (queue -> tpHold -> hand-rolled chase/bring -> Retry) has been REPLACED
-- by the very same nexoRaidEngine that already drives StarRage / Blood / Lightning / Yuta / Judge /
-- Jogo / Toji / Sukuna / AToji / Maki. Verified compatible against the live game: SummerSiege is an
-- ordinary BossIslandsConfig island driven by the identical BossIslandService.CreateIslandQueue /
-- Retry remotes, so the shared flow applies 1:1.
